# A new game with VNext's samples: a cast of three (Mika, Kaede and Haru, each with nine expressions and two close-ups),
# six places, five songs, sounds, the phone, and every menu ready-made with pictures of its own. Use them, change them,
# or swap in your own. Lanterns, the short game on VNext's release page, is made of these same samples.
#
# Music: TERNOX (CC0, ternox.itch.io/vn-music). Pictures: drawn for VNext.

include characters
include extras
include screens

setting title "My game"
setting developer yes
setting game_size 1920 1080
setting character_height 1
setting default.text_speed 45

setting time story
setting time_start Monday 8:00

setting has_phone yes
setting phone_message_sound ping
setting phone_send_sound pop
setting phone_ringtone ring
setting phone_wallpaper phone_wallpaper
setting phone_lock_wallpaper phone_lock

variable name "Sam" "the player's name, as they type it on the Input screen"

scene start
    open title
    show classroom as background with fade_in
    play music/after_school as music fade=2
    show kaede smile with slide_in
    Kaede smile: This is where your story starts.
    Kaede happy: The places, the music, the menus and the three of us are VNext's samples. Use us, change us, or swap in your own.
    show kaede at left
    show mika happy at right with slide_in_right
    Mika happy: Click a line in the Story page to change what we say ♡
